  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Cassidy Lobaugh is an American entrepreneur based in northwest Arkansas. She worked with her husband, Brandon, to develop iQ Foods and designed the Suspended Fresh brand’s logo. She also founded High Society event rentals and Lobaugh Properties, a vacation-rental business offering homes in Oklahoma, New Mexico and Florida for holiday guests.",
    "html": "<p>Cassidy Lobaugh is an American entrepreneur based in northwest Arkansas. She worked with her husband, Brandon, to develop iQ Foods and designed the Suspended Fresh brand’s logo. She also founded High Society event rentals and Lobaugh Properties, a vacation-rental business offering homes in Oklahoma, New Mexico and Florida for holiday guests.</p>\r\n",
